adventure-horror gameplayA first look at our rotoscoped animation and pixel-horror art directionEncounters drawn from Indone","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T10:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4529210-1830797770237752","game_id":"steam-4529210","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You!","summary":"Thank You for Your Support!Since Pondako launched the Steam page for IMAN, the enthusiasm we've received has been incredible. We want to express our deepest gratitude to everyone who has taken the time to discuss the game and help spread the word.As a token of our appreciation, we’d like to share a sneak peek at one of the core gameplay mechanics in IMAN:(Note: This screenshot is a Work-in-Progress and does not represent the final product).We Hear Your FeedbackAlongside the overwhelming support,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-25T01:36:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770237752","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4529210-1830797770234419","game_id":"steam-4529210","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing Our First Horror Game: 'IMAN'","summary":"About 'IMAN'IMAN is a 2D horror-adventure game. Step into the shoes of Rudi, a devout young man, in a chilling experience heavily inspired by the widely beloved \"FAITH: The Unholy Trinity\". Unravel dark mysteries, save the possessed, and rely on your faith to survive the deceit of cursed demons.Developed by PondakoPondako is an indie development team based in South Tangerang, Indonesia. As of this announcement, you can follow our journey and connect with us on our offici